/Title (Secure sufficient resources and enable civil society participation. Adequate funding, staff capacity, and engagement of NGOs are critical to provide comprehensive services, including psychosocial support, legal assistance, and awareness-raising for returnees. For Iraq, this entails increasing government budget allocations, seeking international support, and integrating civil society in complementary service delivery.)
