/Title (Promote awareness, simplify procedures, and strengthen monitoring. Transparent communication, streamlined administrative procedures, and continuous monitoring improve trust, reduce inefficiencies, and support effective reintegration. In Iraq, this includes raising awareness of the NRM, reducing bureaucratic barriers in document issuance, and establishing independent monitoring and evaluation mechanisms  references)
